{"rpid": "5111404", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "Koverpb", "mid": "488385", "level": 4, "vip": 0, "content": "苏軍有Lun class ekranoplan, 就是兩棲突擊地效飞行器了,4挺23mm, 6具SS-N-22(P-270,PLA也有) 載重100噸, 航程2000km, 巡航速度450 km/h \n伊朗軍方有3中隊的2人地效飞行器 Bavar-2,裝有一挺MG和監測裝備\n美國方面波音設計了桇 Pelican ULTRA (Ultra Large Transport Aircraft) \n航程18000km, 載重1400噸,巡航速度445 km/h", "like": 2, "ctime": 1354954083, "rcount": 2, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "409678", "video_bvid": "BV16x411F7oJ", "video_title": "蛇盘怪物！国产地效飞行器", "video_desc": "国产神器，在民科面前颤抖吧", "video_owner": "萌战天使", "video_view": 33284, "video_reply": 74, "video_n1": 38, "video_n2": 35}
